      "created_at": "2016-03-05T13:11:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The only thing I want is a \"3rd Ed\" of the core set that has errata and updated art!  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=9\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\">  (I suppose they could look at doing some of the expansions (such as Rook City), but I'd be fine with just the core set.</p>\n<p>I honestly wouldn't want the mechanics used for another property. That would end up needing to be balanced against the existing game (as folks would play it that way!) and that would be kinda annoying to me. But I tend to focus more on theme and story than mechanics, so that's probably just me.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>",
