      "created_at": "2016-03-05T14:36:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I wouldn't mind seeing a new edition of the core set.</p><p>I'd hate to have to buy the entire game all over again, though.</p><p>I love Sentinels, but I hope future games take different approaches. I want to see what other kinds of cooperative games might be lurking in Christopher's brain, and hopefully he'll give us something as cool as Sentinels.</p>",
